    <h1 class="p-blogart__ttl">わたしの進む道〜歯科衛生士学科編〜</h1>
    <figure class="p-blogart__eyecatch"><img src="/asset/img/uploads/2025/08/1-2-900x636.jpg" alt="" width="900" height="636" loading="lazy"></figure>
